  "headline": "Search Ends at Bogor Illegal Gold Mine With 13 Dead And 14 Missing",
  "seoTitle": "Search Ends at Bogor Illegal Gold Mine With 14 Missing",
  "metaDescription": "Search and rescue operations concluded at an illegal gold mine in Bogor following a landslide. 13 miners were confirmed dead with 14 others still missing.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Search and rescue teams have officially ended efforts to find missing miners at the Ciguha and Pongkor illegal gold mine sites in Bogor.",
    "The incident resulted in 13 confirmed deaths, while 14 individuals remain missing and unaccounted for following the landslide.",
    "Authorities have designated two suspects in connection with the illegal mining operation and are continuing investigations into the site's management."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A major search and rescue operation at an illegal gold mining site located in the Ciguha and Pongkor areas of Bogor has concluded. The tragedy occurred after a landslide trapped numerous miners, known locally as gurandil, within the subterranean tunnels. According to official reports, the death toll has reached 13, with an additional 14 individuals still missing as the mission was called off. Law enforcement agencies have since taken action against the operation, designating two suspects and seizing equipment, including 81 ore processing units. Authorities also revealed that some illegal processing activities were masked under the guise of agricultural businesses. Investigations are ongoing, with police actively pursuing individuals responsible for financing and managing the unauthorized mining activities that led to the collapse at Gunung Butak.",
